      "message": "\u003e The diff cache already does that. Am I missing something?\n\nYes. The problem here was that in the squash case the rebase detection in ListOfFilesUnchangedPredicate wrongly filtered out a file. I understood your comment at [1] that you are concerned that the rebase detection in the diff cache could also wrongly filter out a file, which is something which is not covered by a test yet but I\u0027m not sure it\u0027s even possible to trigger this. All I\u0027m saying here is that if this was possible, removing the {PS1 vs. PS2} diff from ListOfFilesUnchangedPredicate would have fixed this too. So I think we are good. Maybe I just got you wrong then. \n\n[1] https://gerrit-review.git.corp.google.com/c/gerrit/+/374257/1..2//COMMIT_MSG#b30",
